  "system": {
    "slug": "liara-tsoni",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 10
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Dr. Liara T'Soni is an asari archaeologist specializing in Prothean ruins and, later, the galaxy's foremost information broker as the Shadow Broker. She is a powerful biotic and a keen intellect, combining battlefield control with deep scientific knowledge. Her biotics can immobilize, hurl, and shred opponents with equal ease.</p><p><strong>Warp (2 actions):</strong> One target within 60 feet takes 3d10+6 force damage (DC 28 Will for half). On a critical failure, the target is Weakened 2 until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Singularity (3 actions, 1/encounter):</strong> A 15-foot burst within 60 feet. All creatures in the area must succeed on a DC 28 Reflex save or be pulled to the center and Restrained for 1 round.</p><p><strong>Stasis (2 actions, 1/encounter):</strong> One target within 60 feet must succeed on a DC 28 Will save or be Stunned 2.</p><p><strong>Kinetic Barrier:</strong> 50 Shield HP. Recharges 15 HP per turn.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
